---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — Monkey Bomb Tag Guide" description="Terms of service for Monkey Bomb Tag Guide fan site." path="/terms/">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
  <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-4">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> May 31, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Unofficial Fan Site</h2>
    <p>Monkey Bomb Tag Guide &amp; Tools is an <strong>unofficial fan-made companion site</strong>. We are NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Roblox Corporation, Crazay Games, or Syn. All game names, assets, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Calculators Are Estimates</h2>
    <p>All calculators (survival odds, banana earnings, case drop rates) provide <strong>estimates only</strong>. They are based on observed game data and mathematical models, not official game data. Actual in-game results will vary.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">No Guarantee</h2>
    <p>We strive for accuracy but <strong>make no guarantees</strong> about the correctness of codes, drop rates, earnings estimates, or any other data. Game data changes with updates — always verify in-game.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">User Responsibility</h2>
    <p>Use this site and its tools at your own risk. You are responsible for your own in-game decisions. We are not liable for any losses or issues arising from use of information on this site.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Content</h2>
    <p>Original content on this site is free for personal, non-commercial use. Game-related content and assets belong to their respective owners. Do not redistribute our original content without permission.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of updated terms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/" class="text-green-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
